WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.540
Punjab, 1780.

2
00:00:02.590 --> 00:00:06.020
A baby is born to the chief
of a Sikh warrior band.

3
00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:08.960
Smallpox leaves him blind in one eye.

4
00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:11.410
He has little schooling, but he can ride,

5
00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:13.700
fight and judge people.

6
00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:16.540
In 1799 he takes Lahore.

7
00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:20.540
In 1801 he is proclaimed
Maharaja of Punjab.

8
00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:23.580
People call him the Lion of Punjab.

9
00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:28.720
So was his empire truly Sikh, or
simply fair to people of all faiths?

10
00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:32.380
In this mission, you'll read
the words stamped on his coins.

11
00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:36.990
Then you'll weigh the evidence for and
against calling his state religious.

12
00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:41.030
Your mission: weigh up whether
Ranjit Singh's empire was Sikh,

13
00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:43.150
or simply fair to all faiths.
